.TH start-cli-registry-admin-reader-edit 1  "edit "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-registry\-admin\-reader\-edit \- Change the label of a registry reader key
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli registry admin reader edit\fR <\fB\-\-label\fR> [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change the label of a registry reader key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-label\fR \fI<LABEL>\fR
Label identifying the reader key
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
ID of the reader key
